Exercise 4: Compare Lists by Count of Large Numbers

משווה בין 2 רשימות
באיזה רשימה יש מספרים גדולים יותר של השוואה של תא מול תא 
list1 = [3, 5, 30, 0] 
list2 = [1000, 5, 29, -5]  
# Count how many numbers in each list are larger than numbers in the other list
larger_in_list1 = sum(1 for num1 in list1 for num2 in list2 if num1 > num2)
larger_in_list2 = sum(1 for num2 in list2 for num1 in list1 if num2 > num1)
if larger_in_list1 > larger_in_list2:
    print("List 1 contains more larger numbers compared to List 2.") # Print the results
elif larger_in_list2 > larger_in_list1:
    print("List 2 contains more larger numbers compared to List 1.") # Print the results
else:
    print("Both lists contain the same number of larger numbers.") # Print the results

